        {
          "field": "layoutPositions",
          "text": "Fractal's support article: the spine has 7 settings; setting 1 gives the tallest CPU cooler (77 mm) and setting 7 the thickest GPU (72 mm, or 62 mm for a GPU taller than 131 mm)."
